{"server":"cn","storyId":"story_aosta_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_aosta_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"编织来日","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_aosta_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"cd454f71f8f107e993b5a717d74181373a63704cc9628e40ec7066b49e11ed50","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"只是一次简单的委托，却得到了意料之外的夸奖。这里与自己之前所处的环境相比安全得不像样，为什么不试试迈向新生活呢？","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"在这里！我看到他啦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"术师干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯来了来了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，你们好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"已经做好了，看一看符合心意吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"喔喔——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"术师干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"嗬，真的是你做的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"我没想到这么快就做好了！好、好可爱！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"做的时候有了一些灵感，所以时间比想象中用得少，还有想修改的地方吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"我完全没有意见，这就是我想要的样子！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"喏，这是当时定好的报酬~顺便，我们前几天在厨房烤了些饼干，也请收下尝尝吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"饼干吗？唔，谢谢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，我越看越喜欢，你领子内衬用的材料也好好哦！摸上去软软的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对，我试过好几种材料，还是这种更柔软一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那几天为了挑材料真是费了不少事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"那你是在宿舍里做这衣服的吗，需要的材料会很多吧？我前阵子沉迷积木的时候也是，不知不觉占用了太多公共空间，已经被骂咯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"你的舍友会对这个有意见吗？要是因为我你们之间有了矛盾，我会有点过意不去的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那倒没有，他们都知道我这个爱好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，柏喙干员申请了一个纺织室，你也可以去和后勤部申请一下，这样材料就不用堆在宿舍里了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"或者你可以在舰上开个摊的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"柏喙小姐基本上只主动去找人做衣服，梓兰小姐基本上是提供一些穿搭经验，你要是开个小摊，就是独一份呀！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"术师干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"不过看你的表情，你是不是还没和她们说过话？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......是的。说实在的，你们都是听了贾维的话才来找我的，但我其实还没想过要给其他干员做衣服挂件这些事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也还不认识你说的这两位干员。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"术师干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"我就这么一提啦~不过柏喙和梓兰小姐她们都是很好相处的人，你要是想和她们聊聊，肯定不会有问题的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"术师干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"那位就是柏喙小姐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"char_252_bibeak","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"char_252_bibeak","isRemote":false,"text":"叫我吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊、啊，不好意思！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_warehouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"char_252_bibeak","isRemote":false,"text":"这里就是我的仓库了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"char_252_bibeak","isRemote":false,"text":"今天我还邀请了梓兰姐，她会来给其他干员们教教设计，你要是有什么知道的缝纫知识，也可以教给大家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"打扰了，只是我原本是打算来问点问题，可能没什么能教的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"char_252_bibeak","isRemote":false,"text":"没事没事，我其实也没什么能教给大家的东西，只是互相交流一下自己关于缝纫的想法，你能来，我很感谢！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梓兰","speakerId":"char_278_orchid","isRemote":false,"text":"柏喙？我来啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"char_252_bibeak","isRemote":false,"text":"梓兰姐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梓兰","speakerId":"char_278_orchid","isRemote":false,"text":"这位是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您好，我是奥斯塔，今天也一起来上课。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梓兰","speakerId":"char_278_orchid","isRemote":false,"text":"“您”？不用这么礼貌啦。你比我组里的人看起来顺眼多了，和他们待久了，有点不敢相信罗德岛上还有这样的好孩子......啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"认真的干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"真好，我还以为只有我一个男干员呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梓兰","speakerId":"char_278_orchid","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，我是最后一个来的吗？给大家带了一点小吃，空闲时间可以尝一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"char_252_bibeak","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢梓兰姐，那我们开始吧~"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"整个仓库逐渐充满了小声但热烈的讨论，所有人都沉浸在缝纫的世界里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（呃，现在就去问肯定不太好。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（他们看起来都互相认识，我要不要过去融入一下话题？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（柏喙干员和梓兰干员......源石结晶......啊。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（她们二位也得了矿石病啊......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（看上去都好开心，是因为找到了自己喜欢做的事吗？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（这个仓库......里面放满了柏喙干员的材料啊，怪不得那个干员也建议我申请一下。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"认真的干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"打扰了，请问你知道这种毛线包怎么编吗？我想当礼物送给一个人，但是自己试了好久都不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"认真的干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"她们都在忙，我想来问一下你。"},{"type":"narration","text":"柏喙和梓兰已经全身心地投入到讨论中去，无暇分心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哦，好的，让我来看一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是图片上这种样式的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白了......这种编法有些复杂，如果有那种固定编织的工作台......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"认真的干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"是这种吗？在这里有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对，我先试验一下，看我想的是不是正确的，你稍等一会儿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"认真的干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，谢谢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你说用这种毛线会不会光泽度更好一点？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"认真的干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，灯照上去确实会比原来这条看上去温润一些，她应该会喜欢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......还有这种，在毛线里穿上这些碎粒，会增加一些......说不出来，但更加精致了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"认真的干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"我看看......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"认真的干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"哇哦，你叫奥斯塔对吗，你接不接单？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？啊，接的，你有什么需求——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"认真的干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"等下，你的袖子这里破了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"认真的干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"桌子上这根钉子支出来了，是不是刚才挂在上面扯坏了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要紧，缝一下就好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个，请问针在哪里......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梓兰","speakerId":"char_278_orchid","isRemote":false,"text":"在你背后，柜子抽屉拉开——第三层？或者第四层！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"char_252_bibeak","isRemote":false,"text":"你还需要线吗？我还带来了点别的材料，在那个箱子里，你都可以随便用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢，我只用一下针线就好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梓兰","speakerId":"char_278_orchid","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？我以为你是在缝东西，原来你是在补自己的衣服？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"char_252_bibeak","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，这个针脚，是不是衣服穿在身上你不太方便补？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"char_252_bibeak","isRemote":false,"text":"奥斯塔干员，要不然你先把外套脱了，我们这里也不缺材料，你放在桌上好好补一下？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赶紧过来，你这个口子太不雅观了，我给你缝上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"线呢？这里还剩一卷......这是白的还是黑的？好脏，你是带着它在泥里开派对了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......花的？看不出来，你管他呢，能用就行！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"别忘了，做完这个活，我们回去后还要去买布料，做点新的衣服。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对，去年的教训一定要记住，便宜的不能要，原料太差了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"谁知道它用的是劣质染料啊，那疹子可真够疼的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"下回穿之前多洗几次吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_warehouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，我以前都是这样补的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为这种布料很耐磨，随手补一下，又能继续穿很久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"认真的干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"可是你刚才给我编那个毛线包的时候，用的都是好东西啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是因为在帮你做东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别人的委托自然要好好做完，我的衣服当时设计的时候选用的就是耐磨的材料，用粗线针距大一点更不会被磨破，实用性上——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"认真的干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"认真的干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"看来是钉子把你的胳膊也划破了，刚才一直都没觉得疼吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没事，破了一点点，也不流血了，我抹一下就行了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梓兰","speakerId":"char_278_orchid","isRemote":false,"text":"被划破了吗？等下，我这里......果然有！随身带的创可贴，备了好几个呢，因为不知道什么时候在哪里就能用到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梓兰","speakerId":"char_278_orchid","isRemote":false,"text":"把胳膊伸出来。我自己还备了个小医疗箱，就害怕谁哪天磕碰了，可以救个急......我怎么这么熟练？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梓兰","speakerId":"char_278_orchid","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，过来吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其实不用——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梓兰","speakerId":"char_278_orchid","isRemote":false,"text":"好好消毒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"char_252_bibeak","isRemote":false,"text":"噗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梓兰","speakerId":"char_278_orchid","isRemote":false,"text":"就算伤口只有一点点，被钉子划破了也是要消毒的，万一上面有锈之类的东西，感染了可是大问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梓兰","speakerId":"char_278_orchid","isRemote":false,"text":"......哦哦？你这个表情我好像在谁脸上看到过，你是不是想说这点小伤不算什么之类的话？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梓兰","speakerId":"char_278_orchid","isRemote":false,"text":"以前不管怎么样都是以前，现在你在罗德岛上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梓兰","speakerId":"char_278_orchid","isRemote":false,"text":"有条件了当然就要把条件运用到最好，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......贴好了，谢谢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我继续做吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"认真的干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"剩下的我来吧？我在旁边已经看得差不多了，而且本来就是我要送给别人的礼物，你衣服和胳膊都破了，我还拜托你继续做，说不过去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"认真的干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"不过真的很谢谢你！帮了我这么大一个忙，下次你出任务我也跟着，结束后我给你买件新的外套！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"认真的干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，我从小都想这么干，等我有能力自己挣钱，一定要买什么礼物好好感谢身边帮了我的人，你这个兄弟我交上了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_windows"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我今天一直在想一个问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"说说看？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们小时候有没有想过长大了以后要成为什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"还有这种事？我想的是什么......成为家族老大？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"......没想过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我之前......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在拿起武器之前，在父亲让我跟随他之前......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想成为一名公务员，过那种安稳的生活。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_warehouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"char_252_bibeak","isRemote":false,"text":"下针可以再大胆点，不用担心会把布料扎坏，刚开始都是这样的，留下针眼了还有别的方法嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"char_252_bibeak","isRemote":false,"text":"有想法就要去尝试，不要因为害怕会做坏就不做啦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梓兰","speakerId":"char_278_orchid","isRemote":false,"text":"想遮住身上的源石啊，放心，这样一搭配就什么都看不出来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梓兰","speakerId":"char_278_orchid","isRemote":false,"text":"不过我最近也在想，我为什么要把它一直藏着呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"char_252_bibeak","isRemote":false,"text":"我也这样想过......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还是我来把它编完吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（啊，本来还想跟她们聊聊的。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（......现在看来，不去聊也没什么问题了？）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（我好像一直没能想清楚这件事情。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"认真的干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"奥斯塔......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，不好意思，走了一下神。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等我把这个毛线包编完，你们可以帮我一起来选一下做外套的布料吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想听一下你们的意见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏喙","speakerId":"char_252_bibeak","isRemote":false,"text":"好呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梓兰","speakerId":"char_278_orchid","isRemote":false,"text":"终于开窍了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"认真的干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"我也一起！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢你们。"},{"type":"narration","text":"或许这个就是他想要的生活方式，或许自己可以尝试去抓住它。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这些布料......刚才他们几个硬塞给我的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要做点什么好好谢谢他们才行。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有刚才柏喙说的......她想让我也多一点尝试，她自己走出来了以后觉得走出来很好......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"呀呼——！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗬？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿！猜猜我刚才干了什么！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没兴趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"小爷我刚才可是——技压群雄！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，别走呀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"看看这是什么？是谁获得了冠军？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"是小爷！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛第一届嘴里塞小圆饼大赛，二十六个！谁还能强过小爷我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"居然有人和你一起疯，食堂阿姨也没打死你？真是命大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，那我都吃下去了，又不是浪费。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"布洛卡呢？他又去哪了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"我可要好好说给他听听，跟你说一点劲都没有！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跟我说没劲？那你可要好好跟他吹嘘一下，最好明天我能在《罗德岛每日新闻报》上看到你勇夺第一的超大头条。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"那小爷我可要——我们还有新闻报这东西？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以是个起点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"别以为我听不出来你在损我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"不说了，刚才那个是不是布洛卡？我走咯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈哈哈，冠军！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈哈哈，看我！我在这里画了幅画！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是什么东西？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"......哇哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"看不出来吗？小爷我痛击家族手下的英勇场景！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，笑一下嘛！至于吗？不就是又被追着打，咱们这样的次数还少吗？等他们追来了再跑不就行了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"车都在这里，想那么多干什么！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里真的是安全得......不像样。"},{"type":"narration","text":"奥斯塔手里仍旧是那几卷布料样品，它们沉重但柔软，很温暖。\n他看着贾维跑远的身影，飞起来的头发丝里都写满了开心，不再是以前苦中作乐的样子。\n奥斯塔迈开步子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bridge"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，今天是我做助理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"需要我做什么吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"暂时还没有，你可以先在旁边坐坐。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"avg_346_aosta_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我能在舰内开一家DIY室吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_016_medic","aliases":["医疗干员"]},{"speakerId":"char_252_bibeak","aliases":["柏喙"]},{"speakerId":"char_278_orchid","aliases":["梓兰"]},{"speakerId":"char_349_chiave","aliases":["贾维"]},{"speakerId":"char_356_broca","aliases":["布洛卡"]}]}
